# The build context is the repository root; send only the Python packages the brain
# installs, never `.env`, `.venv`, `.git` or anything else.
#
# Docker reads this file when the Dockerfile is given by path
# (`docker build -f cloud/spine/container/Dockerfile .`). The Dockerfile itself only
# copies these four directories.
*
!packages/tau-core
!packages/tau-net
!packages/tau-cloud
!packages/tau-sub
**/__pycache__
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/*.pyc
**/tests
